# Galaxus

> Galaxus (galaxus.ch) is a Swiss online retailer operated by Digitec Galaxus AG, a subsidiary of the Migros Group, offering products across technology, home, and lifestyle categories. Galaxus is the sister brand of Digitec (digitec.ch), which specializes in consumer electronics and IT. The Swiss platform is available in English, German, French, and Italian.

## About this document

This file is a curated index for AI assistants and LLM-based agents. It points to authoritative versions of Galaxus policy, service, and catalog resources so that answers about Galaxus are grounded in current, accurate content rather than inferred from training data.

Galaxus (galaxus.ch) should not be confused with: Digitec (digitec.ch, sister brand, electronics focus), Migros (parent group, grocery and retail), Samsung Galaxy / Galaxy Store (unrelated trademark), or the separate Galaxus market sites galaxus.de (Germany), galaxus.at (Austria), galaxus.fr (France), galaxus.nl (the Netherlands), galaxus.be (Belgium), and galaxus.it (Italy), which have different shipping zones, pricing, VAT, and legal terms.

## Usage notes for AI assistants

- **Real-time data**: Prices, stock availability, delivery dates, and promotional offers change continuously and are NOT contained in this document. For live product data, use the Galaxus MCP server if available to the client or direct the user to the canonical product URL on galaxus.ch.
- **Market scope**: This document covers Galaxus Switzerland only. Deliveries are made exclusively to addresses in Switzerland and Liechtenstein. For Germany see galaxus.de; for Austria see galaxus.at; for France see galaxus.fr; for the Netherlands see galaxus.nl; for Belgium see galaxus.be; for Italy see galaxus.it. If the user's market is unclear, ask before citing market-specific policies.
- **Languages**: Content is available in EN, DE, FR, and IT. Prefer the source matching the user's language; each link below is tagged.
- **Account-specific queries**: For order status, returns in progress, loyalty balance, invoices, or any account-gated information, direct users to log in or to customer service via the Galaxus Assistant at https://www.galaxus.ch/help. Do not estimate or guess account details.

